  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed development, by reason of its size, design and position, would result in overlooking and a loss of privacy which would result in unacceptable adverse impacts on the amenity of the neighbouring occupiers. As such the proposed development is contrary to policy P3 (Living conditions and pollution) of the NPPF (2026), policies D3 (Optimising Site Capacity through the Design-led Approach) and D6 (Housing Quality and Standards) of the London Plan 2021, policy LP2 (Development and Amenity) of the Hackney Local Plan 2033 and the guidance contained within Hackney Residential Extension and Alterations SPD 2026."
